  "summary": "The FBI said on 31 October 2026 that North Korea was responsible for the theft of more than 6 billion US dollars in crypto assets from Binance on or about 29 October, and named the activity 'TraderTraitor', which is linked to the Lazarus group. The blockchain analytics firms TRM Labs and Chainalysis had already linked the attack to the same group. According to the FBI, the stolen assets are mainly being converted into Ether, and the FBI, the US Secret Service and IRS-CI are asking crypto service providers to block transactions with the listed addresses.",
